   "title": "Lighting",
   "body": [
    "Over the past 20 years, since the Original Globe was meticulously reinvented from an antique dating from the 1830s, Jamb has developed a long lineage of lighting, including the iconic hanging globes, lanterns, wall lights, dish lights and more. With bespoke scalability and a wealth of hand-finishes, each light is a symbol of exquisite workmanship, attention to detail and rich historic referencing."
